          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संबंध — sambandh — \"a connection; a relationship\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "या दोन घटनांचा एकमेकांशी काही संबंध नाही. yā don ghaṭnāñcā ekmekāṁśī kāhī sambandh nāhī. These two events have no connection with each other."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "X चा Y शी संबंध (sambandh) असणे, X is connected with Y."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संबंध (sambandh) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit sambandha, \"binding together, connection\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
