              "text": "याउलट — yāulaṭ — \"on the contrary; by contrast\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भाऊ शांत आहे, याउलट बहीण खूप बोलकी आहे. bhāū śānt āhe, yāulaṭ bahīṇ khūp bolkī āhe. The brother is quiet; by contrast, the sister is very talkative."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "या + उलट, this + the reverse."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "याउलट (yāulaṭ) is built from या, \"this\" (oblique), and उलट, \"the reverse\": the reverse of this. उलट goes with the verb उलटणे; CDIAL lists Marathi ulaṭṇẽ, \"to be upset, to turn over\", under ullaṭati, \"turns over\" (CDIAL 2368)."
            }
          ]
        },
